WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.579 --> 00:00:07.094
In More → Appearance, choose Photo, then open Background Photos

2
00:00:07.094 --> 00:00:13.749
Tap +, select several photos, then add them

3
00:00:13.749 --> 00:00:18.289
Tap Adjust Photo, drag to frame it, then tap Done

4
00:00:18.289 --> 00:00:21.038
Checked photos are used for your everyday background

5
00:00:21.038 --> 00:00:26.595
Each Time You Open changes photos on opening; Once a Day changes them daily

6
00:00:26.595 --> 00:00:43.484
Tap Add Special Day, choose a photo, and add a Yearly date

7
00:00:43.484 --> 00:00:54.857
For Monthly, select multiple dates, such as the 1st and 15th

8
00:00:54.857 --> 00:01:05.143
For Weekly, select more than one weekday, then add the rule

9
00:01:05.143 --> 00:01:11.167
Go back and save. Your photo appears behind Record
